  "identityStatus": "Shared campus Q156591 plus distinct way245190611/native35184617279443. The official Pavilion page places it between Art Museum and Book of Names. The existing PMTiles outline and ordinary campus aerial fix this independent range beside the Art Museum. The large mapped polygon includes the open Square of Hope area: do not fill it with a solid box or roof. Its courtyard/end-wall and curved-stair assignment is a picture-led reconstruction. Internal+X follows the mapped southeast axis; +Z faces southwest toward the curved planted wing. The end-wall portal faces-X into the courtyard. Heading0 bakes the signed axes into model east/south. No invented member Wikidata item; portal/notch/window positions are approximate.",
